Z||000005||FNXRISING||11-22-2000||03:54 AM||||Its interesting that I stumble upon this topic tonight, as I have been going back and forth between re-arranging my snake tanks and the doing computer stuff!  But, yes, I do own snakes.  I had a Burmese Python for five years, but she died last year of a heart attack.  She was so pretty, and 17 feet long, I might add!  <P>Right now I own some young ones.  My Ball Python babies both died within three weeks of each other last month, so now I have a two month old albino corn, a four month old black /white banded kingsnake, two two month old black/white banded kings, a two month old Mexican black king, a three month old albino banded king, and a two week old orange/black spotted African Desert Boa.<P>Whew!<P>I probably will get another ball python, as I think they are my favorite.  I don't really want anther large snake.  These small ones will do me fine for awhile.  I will email you pics if you like.<P>BTW, I'm one of those "hippies" that don't want Bush around...   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P>fnxrising||||reg||10
