Z||000018||RossT||11-22-2000||06:16 AM||||Chuck, sounds like your as old as me.<P>I have a 135 gallon fish tank, only fish no snakes yet!!  I am thinking of adding a ropefish(reedfish)(bichir).  They look just like a snake.  They also have a swim bladder/lung thing that alows them to live outside the water for a long time.  They can get up to 2-3 feet long. Don't think the wife likes the idea but what the heck, she let me buy a fiero!!<P>Ross<p>[This message has been edited by RossT (edited 11-22-2000).]||||reg||1
